        "app_name": "vesktop",
        "body": "# One life. No revives. No takebacks :LegendaryHC: \n\n***Legendary Hardcore*** is a permanent deathban Hardcore SMP with no map resets, and no revives. So far in its **17 month history**, over 37,000 players have joined, and 19,000 have died trying to survive. This is a **public server** that you can join **RIGHT NOW!** \n\n**PvP, raiding, and griefing** is enabled across its massive 1mil x 1mil block map. Every step could be your last.\n\nThe server is **completely vanilla**, enhanced by plugins to improve the Hardcore experience. These include Player Heads, accessing dead players enderchests, Simple Voicechat, advanced player statistic tracking, and much more.\n\nMany legends have joined, forming bases and alliances that dominated the servers history, only to die, leaving a new spot for the next player to take over. All events on the server are **entirely unscripted and player-led**, creating genuine connections, conflict, and betrayal. \n\nMuch of the servers history can be found on our player-maintained wiki, incl",
